    "headless": "native",
    "planned": "M1",
    "extension": false,
    "notes": [
      "A parent loop (Error: Loop in parents) rolls the whole operator back; Blender keeps the children parented before the loop.",
      "ARMATURE_ENVELOPE on a mesh with a Subdivision Surface modifier answers NotImplementedError (Blender weights the limit surface)."
    ]
